  "display_title": "Cafe Midnight",
  "description": "Cafe Midnight isn't your average cafe. It opens from dusk till dawn, the master never ages, and... it's a time slip?! There are visitors from different backgrounds and different time periods, all with their own stories to tell. One thing that they have in common? They've all somehow found their way to Cafe Midnight, where they can encounter those living in the present, past, and future. No one really knows the purpose of the cafe, but one thing's for sure-- it's magical.\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
